.TH EPISMO 1
.SH NAME
epismo \- command-line interface for Epismo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B epismo
[global options] command [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Epismo is an agent-first CLI. Commands return JSON by default and support
table, YAML, JSONL, and scalar output for interactive terminal use.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B -w, --workspace ID-OR-HANDLE
Select a workspace for this command. An exact workspace ID or unique handle is accepted.
.TP
.B -o, --output FORMAT
Use json, table, yaml, jsonl, or value output.
.TP
.B --diagnostic-format FORMAT
Use json or human diagnostics on standard error.
.TP
.B --field PATH
Select a dotted field path with --output value.
.TP
.B --jq PROJECTION
Apply a field projection such as .playbooks[] | .id.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Preview an impactful operation without sending it.
.TP
.B -y, --yes
Skip an interactive confirmation prompt.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
epismo workspace use acme
epismo -w acme playbook search onboarding --output table
epismo playbook init --title Onboarding > playbook.json
epismo playbook create --definition @playbook.json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.B epismo --help
and
.B epismo docs <command>
